# wip433: the step chance (TRIG %) takes the whole screen, big, while you turn SELECT with a step held
# (it was a small text in the header bar that nobody saw). The shots are to be looked at; the expects check the chance itself.
wait 300
expect part 0
shot chance_before.png
key w0 down
turn SELECT -10
wait 100
shot chance_50.png
turn SELECT -9
wait 100
shot chance_5.png
turn SELECT 25
wait 100
shot chance_100.png
turn SELECT -20
wait 100
shot chance_cond.png
key w0 up
wait 2000
shot chance_gone.png
welcomever
shot welcome_ver.png
